      "The screenshots were taken on Odoo 19 in a database seeded with made-up data: six fictitious users (a salesperson, a sales manager, an accountant, an HR officer, a Settings administrator and a plain internal user) and one over-grant planted on purpose, so the review has something to find. The data is synthetic, and every number quoted beside a screenshot is read off that screenshot."
