    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "Does it delete the record?",
        "a": "No. It writes blank values into the fields you picked and keeps the record. For deleting or archiving whole records use Odoo's Data Recycle."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I preview what a rule will touch?",
        "a": "The form shows how many records match the condition. It does not list them or show a before and after, so test on a copy first."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I undo a run?",
        "a": "No. Cleared values are not stored anywhere. Restore from a backup if you need them back."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does it run by itself?",
        "a": "Yes. One scheduled action runs every active rule once a day. You can also press Run Now on a rule."
      },
      {
        "q": "Why was an archived record not cleared?",
        "a": "A normal search skips archived records. Switch Include archived on in the condition."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I set a rule as \"older than seven years\"?",
        "a": "Not as a rolling window. A condition using context_today, relativedelta or datetime is refused when you save. Use a fixed date and move it forward, or a field that holds the age."
      },
      {
        "q": "What happens to a record under a legal hold?",
        "a": "It is skipped on every run and no log line is written, until the hold is released by unticking Active."
      },
      {
        "q": "Who can see the audit log?",
        "a": "Members of the GDPR Retention Manager group and Settings administrators, read-only. Nobody has create, edit or delete rights on it."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does it clear chatter messages or attachments?",
        "a": "No. It writes only the fields you pick."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is the other Odoo version included?",
        "a": "No. The store sells each Odoo version of an app as a separate product."
      }
    ],
