          "The Targeting tab has countries (comma-separated codes such as US,CA), minimum and maximum age (18 and 65 by default) and gender: All, Male or Female. Anything else, such as interests, goes into Targeting Extra as raw JSON that is merged over the audience the other fields build. Promoted Object is raw JSON for objectives that need one, and is only sent when the ad set is created.",
