          "Tick the invoice for its full balance and the window shows a Deduction Reason field, because the applied total now exceeds the cash. Pick a reason and Apply. The gap is posted to that reason's account, labelled with its name. Without a reason, Apply refuses. Reasons are set up under Invoicing > Configuration > Cash Application Deduction Reasons : a name and a write-off account, which account managers maintain and billing users can read.",
