          "Taxes and totals come from Odoo's own POS calculation, from the product's customer taxes as they are today and the fiscal position (the customer's, when set). The total the check showed is the total created, and it matched an order Odoo made itself. Payments must add up to the total after cash rounding: change is not imported, and an overpayment is refused.",
