          "Accounting, Vendors, Allocate Payment (or Send in the wizard) lists the vendor's open bills; the rest works the same and makes an outbound payment to a supplier. In the made-up run 1,500.00 went 1,000.00 to a 2,000.00 bill and 500.00 to a 750.00 bill; a third bill of 420.00 stayed untouched.",
          "Vendor credit notes are not listed.",
          "The vendor wizard. The wizard window with the amounts filled in (Odoo 19); the page form is the same wizard, opened as a page so that it can be shown readably.",
          "The bill list after the payment. Real Odoo screen (Odoo 19)."
